## 30. CONNECT ALL GAME PHASES

The resource, construction and survival phases must use the same underlying game state.

The following relationships must work:

Exploration → determines discovered locations and scientific information.

Resource collection → updates actual inventory.

Resource processing → converts raw materials into usable resources.

Construction → consumes actual inventory and creates functional structures.

Survival → uses the actual structures, resources and conditions established earlier.

Final report → reflects the player's real decisions and outcomes.

Do not create disconnected activities that merely appear related.

